{"content_hash": "f3c518248cbe95a5", "version_id": 1014, "article_id": 102, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "GTA 6 hands-on: podcasters finish the game and call it the peak of game production", "title_zh": "《GTA6》试玩通关：主播称其不愧是游戏工业巅峰", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/radios/222501", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605792218927-761ce7dcc100?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8Z3RhJTIwdm9sfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTUwNTYyMDZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Keith Banks on Unsplash", "author": "Keith Banks", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@colorbyibanks?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/man-in-black-jacket-standing-near-road-during-daytime-RVL_lvzr3Ks?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(353, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(31, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "fd193e0ff998"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-19", "word_count": 213, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "A Chinese gaming podcast has played through GTA 6 and shared its impressions without spoilers. The team says Rockstar Games gave them early access, and they describe the title as the high point of the game industry.", "lead_zh": "一档中文游戏播客已经通关《GTA6》，并在不剧透的前提下分享了试玩感受。团队称Rockstar Games提供了提前体验机会，他们形容这款作品是游戏工业的顶点。", "preview": "The episode comes from Gadio Wave, a fast and informal podcast series run by the Chinese gaming site Gcore. Its hosts, Nadya, Xuedou and Bai", "preview_zh": "这期节目来自机核网旗下节奏轻快的播客栏目“机浪”。主持人Nadya、雪豆和白广大表示，Rockstar Games给了他们试玩《GTA6》的机会，他们在节目里聊了通关这款游戏的实际感受。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 997, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 76.225, "size_bytes": 458352, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 233, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 77.625, "size_bytes": 466704, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 233, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/102/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 83.375, "size_bytes": 501264, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 233, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/102/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 71.175, "size_bytes": 427968, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 233, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/102/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 77.5, "size_bytes": 465984, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 233, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/102/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@7c834fab/content/data/versions/1014.json", "paragraphs": ["The episode comes from Gadio Wave, a fast and informal podcast series run by the Chinese gaming site Gcore. Its hosts, Nadya, Xuedou and Bai Guangda, said they were given the chance to try GTA 6 by Rockstar Games, and they used the show to talk through what finishing the game felt like.", "The team avoided story spoilers, but they did confirm several details about the new title. A video version of the same discussion was also posted on Bilibili under the name Hedianbo, where host Ximen gives his own view of the game. The podcast has no fixed schedule or presenters, which lets it react quickly to new releases.", "The title of the episode claims that GTA 6 lives up to its reputation as the top of the game industry, though the hosts also joked that there is simply too much to play. The page notes that Gcore had previously covered a 2022 leak of the series and published an earlier episode about GTA 6 and Vice City.", "The episode drew about 30,100 plays and 99 comments within 15 hours of release, suggesting strong interest among Chinese players. Rockstar Games has not yet shared a release date in this report, and the podcast offered no new official information beyond its own playthrough."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这期节目来自机核网旗下节奏轻快的播客栏目“机浪”。主持人Nadya、雪豆和白广大表示，Rockstar Games给了他们试玩《GTA6》的机会，他们在节目里聊了通关这款游戏的实际感受。", "团队避开了剧情剧透，但确认了新作的若干细节。同样的讨论还以视频播客形式发布在哔哩哔哩的“核电波”账号上，由西蒙谈他对《GTA6》的看法。该播客没有固定更新时间，也没有固定主持，因此能快速回应新作。", "节目标题称《GTA6》配得上游戏工业顶点的名声，主持人们也调侃说游戏内容多到根本玩不完。页面还提到，机核此前报道过该系列2022年的泄露事件，也做过一期关于《GTA6》与罪恶之城的节目。", "这期节目发布15小时内获得约3.01万次播放和99条评论，显示出中国玩家的强烈兴趣。报道中没有提到Rockstar Games公布的发售日期，播客除自身通关体验外也没有提供新的官方消息。"], "body": "The episode comes from Gadio Wave, a fast and informal podcast series run by the Chinese gaming site Gcore. Its hosts, Nadya, Xuedou and Bai Guangda, said they were given the chance to try GTA 6 by Rockstar Games, and they used the show to talk through what finishing the game felt like.\n\nThe team avoided story spoilers, but they did confirm several details about the new title. A video version of the same discussion was also posted on Bilibili under the name Hedianbo, where host Ximen gives his own view of the game. The podcast has no fixed schedule or presenters, which lets it react quickly to new releases.\n\nThe title of the episode claims that GTA 6 lives up to its reputation as the top of the game industry, though the hosts also joked that there is simply too much to play. The page notes that Gcore had previously covered a 2022 leak of the series and published an earlier episode about GTA 6 and Vice City.\n\nThe episode drew about 30,100 plays and 99 comments within 15 hours of release, suggesting strong interest among Chinese players. Rockstar Games has not yet shared a release date in this report, and the podcast offered no new official information beyond its own playthrough.", "body_zh": "这期节目来自机核网旗下节奏轻快的播客栏目“机浪”。主持人Nadya、雪豆和白广大表示，Rockstar Games给了他们试玩《GTA6》的机会，他们在节目里聊了通关这款游戏的实际感受。\n\n团队避开了剧情剧透，但确认了新作的若干细节。同样的讨论还以视频播客形式发布在哔哩哔哩的“核电波”账号上，由西蒙谈他对《GTA6》的看法。该播客没有固定更新时间，也没有固定主持，因此能快速回应新作。\n\n节目标题称《GTA6》配得上游戏工业顶点的名声，主持人们也调侃说游戏内容多到根本玩不完。页面还提到，机核此前报道过该系列2022年的泄露事件，也做过一期关于《GTA6》与罪恶之城的节目。\n\n这期节目发布15小时内获得约3.01万次播放和99条评论，显示出中国玩家的强烈兴趣。报道中没有提到Rockstar Games公布的发售日期，播客除自身通关体验外也没有提供新的官方消息。", "text": "The episode comes from Gadio Wave, a fast and informal podcast series run by the Chinese gaming site Gcore. Its hosts, Nadya, Xuedou and Bai Guangda, said they were given the chance to try GTA 6 by Rockstar Games, and they used the show to talk through what finishing the game felt like. The team avoided story spoilers, but they did confirm several details about the new title. A video version of the same discussion was also posted on Bilibili under the name Hedianbo, where host Ximen gives his own view of the game. The podcast has no fixed schedule or presenters, which lets it react quickly to new releases. The title of the episode claims that GTA 6 lives up to its reputation as the top of the game industry, though the hosts also joked that there is simply too much to play. The page notes that Gcore had previously covered a 2022 leak of the series and published an earlier episode about GTA 6 and Vice City. The episode drew about 30,100 plays and 99 comments within 15 hours of release, suggesting strong interest among Chinese players. Rockstar Games has not yet shared a release date in this report, and the podcast offered no new official information beyond its own playthrough.", "vocab": [{"word": "hands-on", "pos": "adj", "zh": "亲身体验的", "note": "常指实际动手试玩、试用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "spoiler", "pos": "noun", "zh": "剧透", "note": "指提前透露剧情关键内容", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "playthrough", "pos": "noun", "zh": "通关流程", "note": "指完整玩完一款游戏的过程", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "early access", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "提前体验资格", "note": "媒体或玩家在正式发售前获得试玩机会", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "host", "pos": "noun", "zh": "主持人", "note": "播客、节目中的主持者", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "episode", "pos": "noun", "zh": "（节目）一期", "note": "播客或剧集的一集", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "confirm", "pos": "verb", "zh": "确认", "note": "表示证实某信息", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "live up to", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "配得上，不负", "note": "常接 reputation、expectations", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "reputation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "名声，声誉", "note": "可搭配 earn、live up to", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "leak", "pos": "noun", "zh": "泄露（事件）", "note": "指未公开信息被提前曝光", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "release date", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "发售日期", "note": "游戏、电影等正式上线时间", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "informal", "pos": "adj", "zh": "非正式的，轻松的", "note": "形容节目风格随意自然", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-19T02:43:25.218516", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.375, "sm": 250, "em": 375, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "episode", "s": 0.375, "e": 0.9, "sm": 375, "em": 900, "cs": 4, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "comes", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.15, "sm": 900, "em": 1149, "cs": 12, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "from", "s": 1.15, "e": 1.35, "sm": 1150, "em": 1349, "cs": 18, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "Gadio", "s": 1.35, "e": 1.775, "sm": 1350, "em": 1774, "cs": 23, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "Wave", "s": 1.775, "e": 2.425, "sm": 1775, "em": 2424, "cs": 29, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": ",", "s": 2.425, "e": 2.537, "sm": 2425, "em": 2537, "cs": 33, "ce": 34, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "a", "s": 2.538, "e": 2.663, "sm": 2537, "em": 2662, "cs": 35, "ce": 36, 